    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Maddy's Meadow \u2014 a living world that grows and changes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant a seed and watch your garden unfold. Tend to your meadow, fulfill peculiar desires and discover a world of flowers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no timers, no battles, no stress \u2014 just a beautiful, ever-evolving landscape to calm your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your meadow with rare flowers, gentle rains, pastel skies, and drifting leaves. Or simply sit back and let nature take its course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed, Grow and Trade flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill orders to\u00a0 increase the size of your meadow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare visitors like butterflies, bees and fireflies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable flowers and ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal input required \u2014 perfect for background beauty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a little peace today. Your meadow is waiting.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Maddy's Meadow \u2014 a living world that grows and changes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant a seed and watch your garden unfold. Tend to your meadow, fulfill peculiar desires and discover a world of flowers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no timers, no battles, no stress \u2014 just a beautiful, ever-evolving landscape to calm your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your meadow with rare flowers, gentle rains, pastel skies, and drifting leaves. Or simply sit back and let nature take its course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed, Grow and Trade flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill orders to\u00a0 increase the size of your meadow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare visitors like butterflies, bees and fireflies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable flowers and ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal input required \u2014 perfect for background beauty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a little peace today. Your meadow is waiting.</p>",
